#!/usr/bin/env bash
cat <<'EOF'
bin/xdebug has been removed.

Xdebug is now cookie-triggered. The xdebug extension is only loaded in
a dedicated phpfpm-xdebug container, and nginx routes requests to it
when the XDEBUG_SESSION cookie is set.

Browser:
  Use the Xdebug Helper extension (or any cookie toggle) to set/clear
  the XDEBUG_SESSION cookie on the request. No CLI toggling needed.

CLI:
  bin/debug-cli <command>    # runs in the phpfpm-xdebug container
  bin/cli <command>          # runs in the clean phpfpm container

See README -> Xdebug for IDE setup.
EOF
exit 1
